rmat="epo"><addressbook><name>ITO KUNIHITO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MOCHIZUKI NOBUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHIBE TADAYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UCHIDA SEIICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UMEDA NOBUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMADA HIROKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HORIKOSHI, HIROMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, KUNIHITO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MOCHIZUKI, NOBUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHIBE, TADAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UCHIDA, SEIICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UMEDA, NOBUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, HIROKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Phenylazole compounds represented by general formula (1) or pharmaceutically acceptable salts thereof and drugs for hyperlipemia which contain these compounds as the active ingredient, wherein A represents imidazolyl, pyrazolyl, etc.; B represents (1a) or (1b) (wherein R&lt;2&gt; and R&lt;3&gt; represent each hydrogen, C1-6 alkyl, etc.; and k is 0 or an integer of 1 to 15); Y represents O, S, a bond, etc.; and Z represents an optionally substituted and saturated or unsaturated heterocycle containing 1 to 4 N, O or S atoms. Among all, compounds wherein Z is substituted chroman-2-yl, 2,3-dihydrobenzofuran-2-yl, etc. have an effect of inhibiting the formation of lipid peroxides too.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention se rapporte à des composés phénylazole représentés par la formule générale (1) ou à des sels pharmaceutiquement acceptables de ces composés et à des médicaments contenant ces composés en tant que principe actif et destinés au traitement de l'hyperlipidémie. Dans la formule (1), A représente imidazolyle, pyrazolyle, etc.; B représente le composé de formule (1a) or (1b), (où R&lt;2&gt; et R&lt;3&gt; représentent chacun hydrogène, alkyle C1-6, etc.; et k est 0 ou un entier compris entre 1 et 15); Y représente O, S, une liaison, etc.; et Z représente un hétérocycle saturé ou insaturé, éventuellement substitué, contenant 1 à 4 atomes de N, O ou S. Les composés dans lesquels Z est 2,3-dihydrobenzofurane-2-yle, chromane-2-yle substitué etc. possèdent également un effet inhibiteur sur la formation de peroxydes lipidiques.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>